WEBVTT

00:07:30.279 --> 00:07:32.531
So now we have Frontier,

00:07:32.573 --> 00:07:36.243
which is the demand pull
by providing capital and resources

00:07:36.285 --> 00:07:38.913
through the advanced
market commitment mechanism.

00:07:38.954 --> 00:07:41.540
But what about the other side
of the equation?

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:44.335
We also need a supply push.

00:07:44.335 --> 00:07:45.711
To start,

00:07:45.753 --> 00:07:49.256
in addition to all of the new
climate companies being launched,

00:07:49.256 --> 00:07:54.094
we also need companies from existing
industries with transferable skills

00:07:54.094 --> 00:07:56.931
to jump in and start
developing carbon removal.

00:07:57.765 --> 00:07:59.934
I'm talking about --

00:07:59.934 --> 00:08:01.644
now, don't get mad --